  "verseCount": 15,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HOS 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hear ye this, O priests; and hearken, ye house of Israel; and give ye ear, O house of the king; for judgment",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.5.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.5.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "toward you, because ye have been a snare on Mizpah, and a net spread upon Tabor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the revolters are profound to make slaughter, though I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "have been",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.5.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.5.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a rebuker of them all.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I know Ephraim, and Israel is not hid from me: for now, O Ephraim, thou committest whoredom,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.5.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.5.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Israel is defiled.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They will not frame their doings to turn unto their God: for the spirit of whoredoms",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.5.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.5.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the midst of them, and they have not known the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.5.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.5.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the pride of Israel doth testify to his face: therefore shall Israel and Ephraim fall in their iniquity; Judah also shall fall with them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall go with their flocks and with their herds to seek the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.5.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.5.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; but they shall not find",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "him;",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.5.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.5.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he hath withdrawn himself from them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They have dealt treacherously against the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.5.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.5.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": for they have begotten strange children: now shall a month devour them with their portions.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Blow ye the cornet in Gibeah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.5.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.5.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the trumpet in Ramah: cry aloud",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "at",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.5.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.5.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beth-aven, after thee, O Benjamin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ephraim shall be desolate in the day of rebuke: among the tribes of Israel have I made known that which shall surely be.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The princes of Judah were like them that remove the bound:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "therefore",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.5.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.5.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will pour out my wrath upon them like water.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ephraim",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.5.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.5.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oppressed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.5.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.5.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "broken in judgment, because he willingly walked after the commandment.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "will",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.5.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.5.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.5.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.5.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "unto Ephraim as a moth, and to the house of Judah as rottenness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Ephraim saw his sickness, and Judah",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "saw",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.5.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.5.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "his wound, then went Ephraim to the Assyrian, and sent to king Jareb: yet could he not heal you, nor cure you of your wound.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "will be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.5.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.5.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "unto Ephraim as a lion, and as a young lion to the house of Judah: I,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.5.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.5.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I, will tear and go away; I will take away, and none shall rescue",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "him",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.5.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.5.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ I will go",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.5.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.5.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "return to my place, till they acknowledge their offence, and seek my face: in their affliction they will seek me early.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
